WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.945 --> 00:00:08.750
Drop any song onto the Playlist. Right-click the clip and choose Detect tempo and key.

2
00:00:09.173 --> 00:00:12.610
Krypt hears the tempo, key, sections and loudness.

3
00:00:13.495 --> 00:00:18.557
Separate stems splits it into vocals, drums, bass and other, each on its own track.

4
00:00:18.944 --> 00:00:24.238
To turn a whole song into editable patterns, use File, Open audio as project.

5
00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:31.772
Click the clip's channel name to open its window. Auto-warp puts a warp marker on every bar, so the audio follows your tempo.
